\q2 \rb but fools|וֶֽ֝אֱוִילִ֗ים\rb* \rb die|יָמֽוּתוּ׃\rb* \rb for lack|בַּחֲסַר־\rb* \rb of judgment|לֵ֥ב\rb*.
\b 
