\b 
\q1 \v 24 \rb What the wicked man|רָ֭שָׁע\rb*\rb |הִ֣יא\rb* \rb dreads|מְגוֹרַ֣ת\rb* \rb will overtake him|תְבוֹאֶ֑נּוּ\rb*,
\q2 \rb but the desire|וְתַאֲוַ֖ת\rb* \rb of the righteous|צַדִּיקִ֣ים\rb* \rb will be granted|יִתֵּֽן׃\rb*.
\b 
