\q2 \rb but the righteous|וְ֝צַדִּ֗יק\rb* \rb are secure|יְס֣וֹד\rb* \rb forever|עוֹלָֽם׃\rb*.
\b 
\q1 \v 26 \rb Like vinegar|כַּחֹ֤מֶץ׀\rb* \rb to the teeth|לַשִּׁנַּ֗יִם\rb* \rb and smoke|וְכֶעָשָׁ֥ן\rb* \rb to the eyes|לָעֵינָ֑יִם\rb*,
