\q2 \rb but the wicked|וּ֝רְשָׁעִ֗ים\rb* \rb will not|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb inhabit|יִשְׁכְּנוּ־\rb* \rb the land|אָֽרֶץ׃\rb*.
