\q1 \v 18 \rb Like a club|מֵפִ֣יץ\rb* \rb or sword|וְ֭חֶרֶב\rb* \rb or sharp|שָׁנ֑וּן\rb* \rb arrow|וְחֵ֣ץ\rb*
\q2 \rb is a man|אִ֥ישׁ\rb* \rb who bears|עֹנֶ֥ה\rb* \rb false|שָֽׁקֶר׃\rb* \rb witness|עֵ֣ד\rb* \rb against his neighbor|בְ֝רֵעֵ֗הוּ\rb*.
\b 
