\b 
\q1 \v 20 \rb Like one who removes|מַ֥עֲדֶה\rb* \rb a garment|בֶּ֨גֶד׀\rb* \rb on a cold|קָ֭רָה\rb* \rb day|בְּי֣וֹם\rb*
\q2 \rb or vinegar|חֹ֣מֶץ\rb* \rb poured on|עַל־\rb* \rb a wound|נָ֑תֶר\rb*\f + \fr 25:20 \ft Or \fqa on soda\f*
\q2 \rb is one who sings|וְשָׁ֥ר\rb* \rb songs|בַּ֝שִּׁרִ֗ים\rb* \rb to|עַ֣ל\rb* \rb a heavy|רָֽע׃פ\rb* \rb heart|לֶב־\rb*.
