\q2 \rb and if|וְאִם־\rb* \rb he is thirsty|צָ֝מֵ֗א\rb*, \rb give him water|מָֽיִם׃\rb* \rb to drink|הַשְׁקֵ֥הוּ\rb*.
\q1 \v 22 \rb For in so doing|כִּ֤י\rb*, \rb you|אַ֭תָּה\rb* \rb will heap|חֹתֶ֣ה\rb* \rb burning coals|גֶֽחָלִ֗ים\rb* \rb on|עַל־\rb* \rb his head|רֹאשׁ֑וֹ\rb*,\f + \fr 25:22 \ft LXX; Hebrew \fqa For you will heap burning coals on his head\ft ; cited in \ref Romans 12:20|ROM 12:20\ref*\f*
\q2 \rb and the LORD|וַֽ֝יהוָ֗ה\rb* \rb will reward|יְשַׁלֶּם־\rb* \rb you|לָֽךְ׃\rb*.
\b 
