\q2 \rb so a backbiting|סָֽתֶר׃\rb* \rb tongue|לְשׁ֣וֹן\rb* \rb brings angry|נִ֝זְעָמִ֗ים\rb* \rb looks|וּפָנִ֥ים\rb*.
\b 
