\q2 \rb yet a man|גָּֽבֶר׃\rb* \rb will do wrong|יִפְשַׁע־\rb* \rb for|וְעַל־\rb* \rb a piece|פַּת־\rb* \rb of bread|לֶ֝֗חֶם\rb*.
