\c 29
\s1 The Flourishing of the Righteous
\q1 \v 1 \rb A man who|אִ֣ישׁ\rb* \rb remains stiff-necked|מַקְשֶׁה־\rb*\rb |עֹ֑רֶף\rb* \rb after much reproof|תּ֭וֹכָחוֹת\rb*
