\q2 \rb spreads|פּוֹרֵ֥שׂ\rb*\rb |עַל־\rb* \rb a net|רֶ֝֗שֶׁת\rb* \rb for|עַל־\rb* \rb his feet|פְּעָמָֽיו׃\rb*.
