\q2 \rb but a child|וְנַ֥עַר\rb* \rb left to himself|מְ֝שֻׁלָּ֗ח\rb* \rb disgraces|מֵבִ֥ישׁ\rb* \rb his mother|אִמּֽוֹ׃\rb*.
\b 
