\q2 \rb but the righteous|וְ֝צַדִּיקִ֗ים\rb* \rb will see|יִרְאֽוּ׃\rb* \rb their downfall|בְּֽמַפַּלְתָּ֥ם\rb*.
\b 
\q1 \v 17 \rb Discipline|יַסֵּ֣ר\rb* \rb your son|בִּ֭נְךָ\rb*, \rb and he will give you rest|וִֽינִיחֶ֑ךָ\rb*;
