\b 
\q1 \v 18 \rb Where there is no|בְּאֵ֣ין\rb* \rb vision|חָ֭זוֹן\rb*, \rb the people|עָ֑ם\rb* \rb cast off restraint|יִפָּ֣רַֽע\rb*;
