\q2 \rb but a humble|וּשְׁפַל־\rb* \rb spirit|ר֝֗וּחַ\rb* \rb will obtain|יִתְמֹ֥ךְ\rb* \rb honor|כָּבֽוֹד׃\rb*.
\b 
